# working content, not source: prompt drafts and their notes
prompts/

# The repo's root .gitignore carries the generic `lib/` line from the Python packaging
# template, which would silently swallow this folder - and without it a clone has no
# library at all. A negation in this file wins over the shallower pattern, so re-include
# it explicitly. (Renaming the folder is the other option - lib/ is a very common ignore pattern.)
!lib/
